{"id":"9f0df5dc-42f5-45df-b81b-34a63dc774d5","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243735,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT\n  pbm.brand_id,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT pbm.product_id) AS total_products,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN o.order_id IS NOT NULL THEN oi.product_id END) AS sold_products,\n  ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN o.order_id IS NOT NULL THEN oi.price ELSE NULL END), 2) AS sales,\n  ROUND(\n    100.0 * COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN o.order_id IS NOT NULL THEN oi.product_id END)\n    / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT pbm.product_id), 0),\n    2\n  ) AS sell_through_pct\nFROM product_brand_map pbm\nJOIN products p ON p.product_id = pbm.product_id\nLEFT JOIN order_items oi ON oi.product_id = pbm.product_id\nLEFT JOIN orders o ON o.order_id = oi.order_id\n  AND o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\nWHERE pbm.is_current\nGROUP BY pbm.brand_id\nHAVING SUM(CASE WHEN o.order_id IS NOT NULL THEN oi.price ELSE NULL END) IS NOT NULL\nORDER BY sales DESC, pbm.brand_id ASC\nLIMIT 10;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答中文问题，输出一条SQL。需要解析。涉及 brands, product_brand_map, products, order_items, orders. 当前品牌ID 即 product_brand_map.is_current true? 需要按当前品牌ID统计。指标：商品总数、有效订单中动销商品数、不含运费商品销售额两位 和 动销率百分数两位。仅在销售额已知的品牌中取前10，同额按品牌ID升序，严格最多10。\n\n需要确定粒度：按品牌ID。当前品牌映射 is_current. 商品总数：每个品牌当前映射的商品数? 应该 products via product_brand_map current bool. 可能是 COUNT(DISTINCT p.product_id) or product_brand_map rows. 由于 product_brand_map PK(product_id, brand_id), is_current true can have one current per product maybe. \"当前品牌ID\" implies only current mappings. 商品总数 count products mapped to brand currently. 分子动销商品数：有效订单中该品牌当前商品有销量 distinct product_id，order_status NOT IN canceled/unavailable. 销售额：order_items price sum by brand (current mapping) valid orders? 用户说\"不含运费商品销售额\"，并且 \"有效订单中动销商品数\" 只对动销商品数明确有效订单。销售额是否也排除取消/不可用? 依据 valid_order 默认只要题目没明说包含全部订单默认排除。所以销售额应有效订单过滤。动销率 = 动销商品数 / 商品总数 *100 两位。仅在销售额已知品牌中取前10：HAVING SUM(price) IS NOT NULL? \"销售额已知\" means brands with sales sum not null; essentially after inner joins order_items? But 商品总数 includes all products even no sales. 如果 INNER JOIN order_items 会 only brands with sales. But \"仅在销售额已知的品牌中取前10\" means exclude brands with no valid sales, so use INNER JOIN order_items for sales? Yet product total should count all products for brands that have sales? Need careful: For each current brand, total products from product_brand_map current. Sales known maybe no valid sales => SUM(price) null if left join and filter valid in ON. But they want only sales known, maybe top10 order by sales desc. Could compute with LEFT JOIN order_items & orders, group by brand, HAVING SUM(oi.price) IS NOT NULL. This includes brands with sales, total product count counts all current products for those brands. Good. But if filtering valid orders in WHERE via o, left join with no sales would be dropped, but HAVING not needed. If we put order_status NOT IN in WHERE, inner semantics. Then only brands with sales. That's consistent \"仅在销售额已知的品牌\". But could also sales includes canceled? Need default valid order.\n\nNeed \"商品总数\": COUNT(DISTINCT pbm.product_id) maybe over current maps. If product_brand_map has multiple rows per product (including historical), with is_current true one row. Using JOIN product_brand_map pbm ON pbm.product_id = products.product_id AND pbm.is_current. Count distinct product_id. Fine.\n\n\"有效订单中动销商品数\": COUNT(DISTINCT oi.product_id) where o.order_status not in. Because only sales in valid orders. Need distinct by product. Fine.\n\n\"不含运费商品销售额两位\" = ROUND(SUM(oi.price), 2), price is item price excluding freight. Sum price; need avoid duplication due to joins. Join pbm current could potentially multiple current rows per product? PK product_id,brand_id, is_current can multiple is_current but likely one; not guaranteed? Table PK composite only, is_current bool. Could a product have multiple current mappings? Not constrained. But \"当前品牌ID\" uses is_current; if multiple current brands, we join and sales would be attributed to each brand? The mapping semantics maybe current one. Yet schema PK includes brand_id, so multiple brands per product possible; is_current indicates current relation(s). For counting by brand, current mappings. We can assume.\n\nNeed output exact columns? \"按当前品牌ID统计商品总数、有效订单中动销商品数、不含运费商品销售额两位和动销率百分数两位；仅在销售额已知的品牌中取前10，同额按品牌ID升序，严格最多10。\"\n\nOutput columns: brand_id, total_products, active_products? \"有效订单中动销商品数\" perhaps sold_product_count. sales (不含运费商品销售额), sell_through_pct. Need alias Chinese? Use English. Must limit 10 with ORDER BY sales DESC, brand_id ASC. Need only brand_id, metrics. \"前10\" likely top 10 by sales? It says 仅在销售额已知的品牌中取前10，同额按品牌ID升序. Top10 presumably sales ranking. Yes ORDER BY sales DESC.\n\nNeed compute count products per brand and sold distinct. Need combine \"全部商品数\" per brand. If using LEFT JOIN with order_items and orders filtered in ON, then COUNT(DISTINCT pbm.product_id) for total. COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN o.order_status NOT IN ... THEN oi.product_id END) maybe if ON filters valid, then count distinct oi.product_id. But using LEFT JOIN order_items oi ON oi.product_id = pbm.product_id then orders filtered WHERE? If WHERE o.order_status filters, brands without sales excluded. But requirement only sales known, so okay. However total products for brand could be undercounted if product has no valid orders? If we use WHERE o valid, we remove no-sale products from grouping, but count distinct pbm.product_id from only products that sold. Yet total product count should include all products of the brand, not just sold products, for brands with at least one sale. Important! If group by brand from product_brand_map all products, left join order_items, total count all products in brand; then exclude brands with no sales by HAVING SUM(CASE valid sales) IS NOT NULL. But if order_status filter is in ON, all products preserved. Sales sum valid only. So use LEFT JOIN orders with condition order_status NOT IN in ON perh